<title>USA: Missouri Housing Commission bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Missouri Housing Commission bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>MISSOURI HOUSING DEVELOPMENT COMMISSION</p>
<p>RE: $49,725,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(HOMEOWNERSHIP LOAN PROGRAM)</p>
<p>(GNMA/FNMA MORTGAGE BACKED)</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Company</p>
<p>Boatmen's National Bank of St. Louis</p>
<p>B.C. Christopher</p>
<p>Edward D. Jones &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Grigsby Brandford &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
